#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:930
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DirectYouToBattleRoom"
msgid "I'll direct you to your BATTLE ROOM now.$"
msgstr "现在我带你去对战室。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:933
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"You didn't save before you quit your\n"
"challenge last time.\p"
"Because of that, your challenge so far\n"
"has been disqualified. Sorry!$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思！\p"
"你上次中断挑战之前\n"
"没有记录。\p"
"因此，你之前的挑战\n"
"已经被取消资格了。抱歉！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:940
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_CongratsBeatenSeven"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You've beaten all seven TRAINERS!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！\n"
"你打败了全部7位训练家！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:946
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_EarnedFabulousPrize"
msgid ""
"For beating seven TRAINERS in a row,\n"
"you have earned this fabulous prize!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"为了奖励你连续打败7位训练家，\n"
"我们送你这份豪华奖品！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:951
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:956
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_BagFullMakeRoom"
msgid ""
"Oh, your BAG appears to be full.\p"
"Please make room in your BAG, then come\n"
"see me.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的背包好像满了。\p"
"请在背包里腾出空间，\n"
"再来找我吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:961
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ThankYouForPlaying"
msgid ""
"Thank you for playing!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"感谢你的参与！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:965
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_RecordWillBeSaved"
msgid ""
"Your record will be saved.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"你的成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:969
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WeveBeenWaitingForYou"
msgid ""
"We've been waiting for you!\p"
"$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在等你！\p"
"$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:973
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ProgressWillBeSaved"
msgid ""
"Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\n"
"progress will be saved. Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"进入对战室之前，\n"
"要先记录游戏进度。请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:977
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_AboutToFace50thTrainer"
msgid ""
"You're finally about to face the\n"
"50th TRAINER.\p"
"From here on, every time you beat seven\n"
"TRAINERS in a row, your POKéMON will\l"
"receive a commemorative RIBBON.\p"
"Good luck!$"
msgstr ""
"你终于要面对\n"
"第50位训练家了。\p"
"从现在开始，每连续打败\n"
"7位训练家，你的宝可梦\l"
"就会得到一枚纪念奖章。\p"
"祝你好运！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:985
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_HereAreSomeRibbons"
msgid ""
"Here are some RIBBONS for beating\n"
"seven tough TRAINERS in a row.\p"
"{PLAYER} received some RIBBONS!$"
msgstr ""
"这些奖章是奖励你\n"
"连续打败7位强大训练家的。\p"
"{PLAYER}得到了奖章！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:990
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_PutRibbonOnMons"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} put the RIBBONS on\n"
"the challenger POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}给参加挑战的宝可梦\n"
"戴上了奖章。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:994
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DescribeFeelingsAboutBattleTower"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, do you have a moment?\p"
"Can you describe your feelings when\n"
"you're about to begin a BATTLE TOWER\l"
"match, or when you've either won or\l"
"lost a match?$"
msgstr ""
"打扰一下，你有空吗？\p"
"能不能说说你在对战塔\n"
"比赛即将开始的时候，\l"
"或者赢了、输了比赛的时候，\l"
"是什么样的心情？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1001
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FeelWhatWhenYouBegin"
msgid ""
"Okay, what are your feelings when\n"
"you're about to begin a match?$"
msgstr ""
"好，比赛即将开始的时候，\n"
"你是什么心情呢？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1005
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FeelWhatWhenYouveWon"
msgid ""
"What do you feel when you've won\n"
"a match?$"
msgstr ""
"赢了比赛的时候，\n"
"你是什么心情呢？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1009
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FeelWhatWhenYouveLost"
msgid ""
"Can I hear about your feelings when\n"
"you have lost a match?$"
msgstr ""
"能说说你输了比赛的时候\n"
"是什么心情吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1013
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DontThinkMuchAboutIt"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you don't think much about it?\n"
"You're one cool customer.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不怎么在意吗？\n"
"你真是个冷静的人。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1017
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ChangedYourMind"
msgid ""
"Hunh? You changed your mind?\n"
"I guess you're fickle.$"
msgstr ""
"咦？你改变主意了？\n"
"看来你是个善变的人。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1021
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ThatsHowYouFeel"
msgid ""
"Okay, so that's how you feel?\n"
"That's quite original.\p"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"好，原来你是这种心情啊？\n"
"真是很有创意。\p"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1026
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WinsInRowRecorded"
msgid ""
"The number of matches you win in a row\n"
"is recorded.\p"
"I'd better not get beaten in\n"
"an embarrassing way!$"
msgstr ""
"连胜的场数是会被记录下来的。\p"
"我可不能输得太难看！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1032
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_CanLeaveUntilLossOrSevenWins"
msgid ""
"Once you've entered the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
"you can't leave until you either lose\l"
"or you beat seven TRAINERS in a row.\p"
"You'd best be certain that you're up\n"
"to the challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"一旦进入了对战塔，\n"
"在输掉或连续打败7位训练家\l"
"之前都不能离开。\p"
"你最好确定自己\n"
"能够应付这个挑战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1040
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DoubleBattleRoomConstruction"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER\n"
"DOUBLE BATTLE CORNER!\p"
"Unfortunately, the BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"are still under construction.\p"
"Please come back when the work\n"
"is completed.$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到对战塔双打对战区！\p"
"很遗憾，对战室\n"
"还在施工中。\p"
"请等工程完成以后\n"
"再来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1049
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_MultiBattleRoomConstruction"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER\n"
"MULTI BATTLE CORNER!\p"
"Unfortunately, the BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"are still under construction.\p"
"Please come back when the work\n"
"is completed.$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎来到对战塔多人对战区！\p"
"很遗憾，对战室\n"
"还在施工中。\p"
"请等工程完成以后\n"
"再来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1057
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_LookForwardToAnotherChallenge"
msgid ""
"We look forward to seeing you on\n"
"another challenge!$"
msgstr "期待你下次再来挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1061
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE ROOM offers two levels\n"
"of challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""
"对战室的挑战有两种等级：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要选哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1067
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_PleaseSelectMons"
msgid ""
"Please select the POKéMON you wish\n"
"to enter.$"
msgstr "请选择要参加的宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1071
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_OkayToSaveBeforeEntering"
msgid ""
"Before entering a BATTLE ROOM, your\n"
"progress must be saved. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"进入对战室之前，\n"
"必须先记录游戏进度。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1075
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ShowYouToBattleRoom"
msgid ""
"I will now show you to the\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} BATTLE ROOM.$"
msgstr ""
"现在我带你去\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}对战室。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1079
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_RecordLastMatch"
msgid ""
"Shall I record your last BATTLE TOWER\n"
"match on your FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""
"要把你上一场对战塔的对战\n"
"录到开拓通行证里吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1084
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"You don't have {STR_VAR_2} eligible POKéMON.\p"
"You must have {STR_VAR_2} different POKéMON\n"
"of Level 50 or less to enter.\p"
"They also must be holding different\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"不好意思！\p"
"符合条件的宝可梦\n"
"不足{STR_VAR_2}只。\p"
"必须带上{STR_VAR_2}只等级在50以下的\n"
"不同宝可梦才能参加。\p"
"而且，它们携带的道具\n"
"也必须各不相同。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1093
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid "Please come see me when you are ready.$"
msgstr "准备好以后请再来找我。$"

