#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1160
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WelcomSingleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the talents of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\p"
"I am your guide to the SINGLE\n"
"BATTLE ROOMS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家才能的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战塔！\p"
"我是单打对战室的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1167
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_TakeSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the SINGLE\n"
"BATTLE ROOM challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战单打对战室吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1171
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainSinglesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER's SINGLE BATTLE\n"
"ROOMS are facilities for conducting\l"
"SINGLE BATTLES with three POKéMON.\p"
"There are many SINGLE BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"in the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\p"
"In each of the SINGLE BATTLE ROOMS,\n"
"seven TRAINERS await your challenge.\p"
"If you manage to defeat all seven,\n"
"you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战塔的单打对战室\n"
"是用3只宝可梦进行\l"
"单打对战的设施。\p"
"对战塔里有许多\n"
"供队伍对战的单打对战室。\p"
"每间单打对战室里\n"
"都有7位训练家等着你来挑战。\p"
"如果能打败全部7位训练家，\n"
"你就能获得对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1186
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Now please select the three POKéMON\n"
"that are to be entered.$"
msgstr ""
"现在，请选择\n"
"要参加的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1190
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WelcomeDoubleBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the talents of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\p"
"I am your guide to the DOUBLE\n"
"BATTLE ROOMS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家才能的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战塔！\p"
"我是双打对战室的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1197
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_TakeDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the DOUBLE\n"
"BATTLE ROOM challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战双打对战室吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1201
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainDoublesChallenge"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER's DOUBLE BATTLE\n"
"ROOMS are facilities for conducting\l"
"DOUBLE BATTLES with four POKéMON.\p"
"There are many DOUBLE BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"in the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\p"
"In each of the DOUBLE BATTLE ROOMS,\n"
"seven TRAINERS await your challenge.\p"
"If you manage to defeat all seven,\n"
"you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战塔的双打对战室\n"
"是用4只宝可梦进行\l"
"双打对战的设施。\p"
"对战塔里有许多\n"
"供队伍对战的双打对战室。\p"
"每间双打对战室里\n"
"都有7位训练家等着你来挑战。\p"
"如果能打败全部7位训练家，\n"
"你就能获得对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1216
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_PleaseSelectFourMons"
msgid ""
"Now please select the four POKéMON\n"
"that are to be entered.$"
msgstr ""
"现在，请选择\n"
"要参加的4只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1220
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WelcomeMultiBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the talents of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\p"
"I am your guide to the MULTI\n"
"BATTLE ROOMS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家才能的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战塔！\p"
"我是多人对战室的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1227
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_TakeMultisChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the MULTI\n"
"BATTLE ROOM challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战多人对战室吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1231
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainMultisChallenge"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER's MULTI BATTLE\n"
"ROOMS are facilities for conducting\l"
"MULTI BATTLES.\p"
"For MULTI BATTLES, you must partner\n"
"with a TRAINER in the TOWER and enter\l"
"with two POKéMON each.\p"
"Inside the TOWER is a room named\n"
"the BATTLE SALON where you may meet\l"
"other TRAINERS.\p"
"There, you must find a TRAINER to act\n"
"as your partner in MULTI BATTLES.\p"
"Once you have partnered up, you will\n"
"be shown to a MULTI BATTLE ROOM.\p"
"In the MULTI BATTLE ROOM, seven\n"
"tag teams await your challenge.\p"
"If you manage to defeat all seven\n"
"teams, you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"对战塔的多人对战室\n"
"是进行多人对战的设施。\p"
"多人对战时，你必须和\n"
"塔里的一位训练家搭档，\l"
"两人各带2只宝可梦参加。\p"
"塔里有一个叫对战沙龙的房间，\n"
"在那里可以遇到其他训练家。\p"
"你必须在那里找到一位训练家\n"
"作为多人对战的搭档。\p"
"组成搭档后，\n"
"就会被带到多人对战室。\p"
"多人对战室里\n"
"有7组搭档等着你来挑战。\p"
"如果能打败全部7组搭档，\n"
"你就能获得对战点数。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1254
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_PleaseSelectTwoMons"
msgid ""
"Now please select the two POKéMON\n"
"that are to be entered.$"
msgstr ""
"现在，请选择\n"
"要参加的2只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1258
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WelcomeLinkMultiBattle"
msgid ""
"Where the talents of TRAINERS\n"
"are put to the test!\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE TOWER!\p"
"I am your guide to the LINK MULTI\n"
"BATTLE ROOMS.$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家才能的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战塔！\p"
"我是连接多人对战室的向导。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1265
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_TakeLinkMultisChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the LINK MULTI\n"
"BATTLE ROOM challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战连接多人对战室吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1269
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainLinkMultisChallenge"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER's MULTI BATTLE\n"
"ROOMS are facilities for conducting\l"
"MULTI BATTLES with a friend.\p"
"You must link with your friend using\n"
"Wireless Adapters or a Game Boy\l"
"Advance Game Link cable.\p"
"You must partner with your friend and\n"
"enter two different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"There are many MULTI BATTLE ROOMS\n"
"in the BATTLE TOWER for team battles.\p"
"In a MULTI BATTLE ROOM, seven\n"
"tag teams await you and your friend\l"
"to make a tag-team challenge.\p"
"If you manage to defeat all seven\n"
"teams, you will earn Battle Points.\p"
"Please beware that unlike other ROOMS,\n"
"you may not interrupt your challenge.\p"
"Once you start, you must battle seven\n"
"MULTI BATTLES in a row nonstop.$"
msgstr ""
"对战塔的多人对战室\n"
"是和朋友一起进行\l"
"多人对战的设施。\p"
"你必须用无线适配器\n"
"或GBA连接线和朋友连接。\p"
"你必须和朋友搭档，\n"
"带上2只不同种类的宝可梦参加。\p"
"对战塔里有许多\n"
"供队伍对战的多人对战室。\p"
"多人对战室里\n"
"有7组搭档等着你和朋友\l"
"来进行搭档挑战。\p"
"如果能打败全部7组搭档，\n"
"你就能获得对战点数。\p"
"请注意，和其他对战室不同，\n"
"这个挑战不能中途中断。\p"
"一旦开始，就必须\n"
"不间断地连续进行7场多人对战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1290
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_PleaseSelectTwoMons2"
msgid ""
"Now please select the two POKéMON\n"
"that are to be entered.$"
msgstr ""
"现在，请选择\n"
"要参加的2只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1295
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ChoseSameMonAsFriend"
msgid ""
"You have chosen the same kind of\n"
"POKéMON as your friend.\p"
"Please choose two POKéMON different\n"
"from your friend's, match the level\l"
"you wish to enter, and register again.$"
msgstr ""
"你选择了和朋友\n"
"同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"请选择2只和朋友不同的宝可梦，\n"
"并选择相同的参赛等级，\l"
"然后重新登记。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1302
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_LinkMultiOnlyForTwoPlayers"
msgid ""
"The LINK MULTI BATTLE ROOM challenge\n"
"is only for two linked players.$"
msgstr ""
"连接多人对战室的挑战\n"
"只限两名连接的玩家参加。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1306
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FriendAlsoSelectedMon"
msgid ""
"Your friend has also selected\n"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"你的朋友也选择了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1310
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FriendAlsoSelectedMons"
msgid ""
"Your friend has also selected the\n"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"你的朋友也选择了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1314
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FriendChoseDifferentLvlMode"
msgid ""
"Your friend has chosen a different\n"
"battle level.$"
msgstr ""
"你的朋友选择了\n"
"不同的对战等级。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1319
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FriendChoseDifferentLvlModeSameMon"
msgid ""
"Your friend has chosen a different\n"
"battle level.\p"
"Your friend has also selected\n"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"你的朋友选择了\n"
"不同的对战等级。\p"
"你的朋友也选择了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1326
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_FriendChoseDifferentLvlModeSameMons"
msgid ""
"Your friend has chosen a different\n"
"battle level.\p"
"Your friend has also selected the\n"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"你的朋友选择了\n"
"不同的对战等级。\p"
"你的朋友也选择了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1332
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ChooseDifferentMonsMatchLvlMode"
msgid ""
"Please choose two POKéMON different\n"
"from your friend's, match the level\l"
"you wish to enter, and register again.$"
msgstr ""
"请选择2只和朋友不同的宝可梦，\n"
"并选择相同的参赛等级，\l"
"然后重新登记。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1337
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_SaveGameBeforeShowingIn"
msgid ""
"I will save the game before\n"
"showing you in. Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"带你进去之前，\n"
"我要先记录游戏进度。请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1341
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_CongratsDefeatedMaiden"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You have defeated the SALON MAIDEN\l"
"and swept seven TRAINERS!$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！\n"
"你打败了沙龙少女，\l"
"横扫了7位训练家！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1346
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_AwardYouTheseBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your infinite talent,\n"
"we award you these Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你无限的才能，\n"
"我们将这些对战点数送给你。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1350
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Text_ObtainedXBattlePoints"
msgid "{PLAYER} obtained {STR_VAR_1} Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}点对战点数。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1353
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The BATTLE TOWER rules are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着对战塔的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1356
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1359
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainTowerRules"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE TOWER is a facility where\n"
"four types of battles are waged--\l"
"SINGLE BATTLE, DOUBLE BATTLE, MULTI\l"
"BATTLE, and LINK MULTI BATTLE.\p"
"For each of these types, there are\n"
"separate BATTLE ROOMS.\p"
"Please speak with a guide offering\n"
"the type of battle you wish to enter.$"
msgstr ""
"对战塔是进行4种对战的设施：\n"
"单打对战、双打对战、\l"
"多人对战和连接多人对战。\p"
"每种对战都有\n"
"各自的对战室。\p"
"请和负责你想参加的\n"
"对战种类的向导交谈。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1369
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainMonRules"
msgid ""
"Depending on the BATTLE ROOM you are\n"
"entering, you will be required to take\l"
"a certain number of POKéMON.\p"
"The SINGLE BATTLE mode requires\n"
"three POKéMON.\p"
"The DOUBLE BATTLE mode requires four,\n"
"and the MULTI modes both require two.$"
msgstr ""
"根据你要进入的对战室，\n"
"需要带上一定数量的宝可梦。\p"
"单打对战需要\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"双打对战需要4只，\n"
"两种多人对战都需要2只。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1378
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainSalonRules"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE SALON is where you must\n"
"find a partner to form a tag team for\l"
"the MULTI BATTLE ROOM challenge.\p"
"Choose the best partner for you by\n"
"examining other TRAINERS'\l"
"POKéMON and their moves.\p"
"You may choose a new tag partner\n"
"after winning seven straight matches.$"
msgstr ""
"对战沙龙是寻找搭档、\n"
"组队挑战多人对战室的地方。\p"
"请观察其他训练家的\n"
"宝可梦和招式，\l"
"选出最适合你的搭档。\p"
"连续赢下7场比赛后，\n"
"你可以选择新的搭档。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby/scripts.inc:1388
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ExplainMultiLinkRules"
msgid ""
"The LINK MULTI BATTLE Mode is for two\n"
"friends to mount a challenge together.\p"
"You and your friend must be linked with\n"
"Wireless Adapters or a GBA Game Link\l"
"cable.\p"
"You must choose two POKéMON at\n"
"the registration counter.\p"
"These POKéMON must be different\n"
"from those of your friend.\p"
"You may not interrupt this challenge\n"
"in the middle, unlike other modes.$"
msgstr ""
"连接多人对战模式\n"
"是两位朋友一起挑战的模式。\p"
"你和朋友必须用无线适配器\n"
"或GBA连接线连接。\p"
"你必须在登记柜台\n"
"选择2只宝可梦。\p"
"这些宝可梦必须\n"
"和朋友的宝可梦不同。\p"
"和其他模式不同，\n"
"这个挑战不能中途中断。$"
